	(text_box "Power inputs:\nThe DC barrel jack is prepared for 12-28 V nominal supply voltage.\nIt should survive up to 37 V, and operation below 12 V might be possible.\nRecommended 12 V nominal.\n\nThe AC input is for a single winding AC power source. \nThe winding must be capable of producing at least 12 V post rectification @ 20 mA.\nThe winding must not produce more than 37 V no load voltage.\nRecommended 12 VAC nominal. \n\nThe extra GND pin on AC connector is for half bridge rectification or other means of GND referencing the RIAA preamplifier to supply in a bigger amplifier.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
